  "details": "It would be handy for avatar systems if we had a bool representing when the main trigger button has been pressed. \n\nCurrently, we can detect trigger presses on index controllers using the GestureLeft/RightWeight parameters. However, those parameters are mapped to the grip gesture on other controllers. \n\nWe currently don't have a simple/reliable method to simply detect if the user has clicked their primary trigger button.",
